  'How many days until your exam, wedding, or trip? Or how long since an important date? Enter any two dates and instantly get the exact difference in years, months, weeks, and days.', '["date calculator","days between dates","date difference calculator","date duration calculator","calendar calculator","date countdown calculator","calculate days between two dates","months between dates","date range calculator"]', '
<h2>The Role of Precision Calendaring in Modern Project Architecture</h2>
<p>
