  'time-duration-calculator', 'Time Duration Calculator', 'Calculate the exact duration between two dates and times. Find the difference in years, months, days, hours, minutes, and seconds instantly.', 'Utility',
  0, '["date-calculator","business-days-calculator"]', 'Time Duration Calculator - Calculate Time Between Two Dates',
  'Calculate the exact time difference between two dates and times. Find duration in years, months, days, hours, minutes, and seconds for work, projects, events, and scheduling.', '["time duration calculator","time difference calculator","hours between two times","date duration calculator","time calculator","calculate time between dates","duration calculator","date and time calculator","working hours calculator","hours calculator","minutes calculator","elapsed time calculator","time interval calculator","date difference calculator","calculate duration between dates"]', '
